      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَكَمٌ</span></b> : see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَاكِمٌ</span>, in two places; and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُحَكِّمٌ</span>.
